---@field targetServers? gcp.apigee_v1.StringList List of TargetServers referenced in any TargetEndpoint in the API proxy. Typically, you will see this element only when the API proxy was created using the Edge UI. This is a 'manifest' setting designed to provide visibility into the contents of the API proxy.
