---@field type? string Type. Set to `Application`. Maintained for compatibility with the Apigee Edge API.
---@field resources? gcp.apigee_v1.StringList List of the resources included in the API proxy revision formatted as "{type}://{name}".
---@field policies? gcp.apigee_v1.StringList List of policy names included in the API proxy revision..
---@field targetEndpoints? gcp.apigee_v1.StringList List of TargetEndpoints in the `/targets` directory of the API proxy. Typically, this element is included only when the API proxy was created using the Edge UI. This is a 'manifest' setting designed to provide visibility into the contents of the API proxy.
---@field targets? gcp.apigee_v1.StringList List of the targets included in the API proxy revision.
---@field lastModifiedAt? string Time that the API proxy revision was last modified in milliseconds since epoch.
---@field configurationVersion? gcp.apigee_v1.GoogleCloudApigeeV1ConfigVersion Version of the API proxy configuration schema to which the API proxy conforms. Currently, the only supported value is 4.0 (`majorVersion.minorVersion`). This setting may be used in the future to track the evolution of the API proxy format.

