---@field fixedRecurringFee? gcp.apigee_v1.GoogleTypeMoney Fixed amount that is charged at a defined interval and billed in advance of use of the API product. The fee will be prorated for the first billing period.
---@field startTime? string Time when the rate plan becomes active in milliseconds since epoch.
---@field currencyCode? string Currency to be used for billing. Consists of a three-letter code as defined by the [ISO 4217](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_4217) standard.
---@field billingPeriod? gcp.apigee_v1.GoogleCloudApigeeV1RatePlanBillingPeriodEnum Frequency at which the customer will be billed.
---@field paymentFundingModel? gcp.apigee_v1.GoogleCloudApigeeV1RatePlanPaymentFundingModelEnum DEPRECATED: This field is no longer supported and will eventually be removed when Apigee Hybrid 1.5/1.6 is no longer supported. Instead, use the `billingType` field inside `DeveloperMonetizationConfig` resource. Flag that specifies the billing account type, prepaid or postpaid.
